        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(discord): strip attachments >10MB before send to prevent HTTP 413 silent message loss (fixes #99021)",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes #99021.\n\nWhen a Discord media attachment exceeds Discord's 10 MB bot API limit, the entire multipart request (text + file) is rejected with HTTP 413 and silently lost. The message sender sees \"completed\" but the text never reaches the channel.\n\n## Changes Made\n\n1. **send.outbound.ts**: Added `isDiscordEntityTooLargeError` guard. On 413, re-sends as text-only with size-limit note. Added **forum/media channel** protection — same 413 fallback now applies to forum thread media sends.\n2. **send.shared.ts**: `effectiveMaxBytes = maxBytes ?? 10MB`\n3. **send.receipt.ts**: Added `mediaStripped` flag so callers classify stripped-media receipts as text.\n4. **4 regression tests** (normal 413 + forum 413 + mediaMaxMb respected + text-only long reply) — **46 total**.\n5. **_proof_413.sh**: Fixed `set -eo pipefail` and exit code propagation so test failure correctly reports FAIL.\n\n## Real Behavior Proof\n\n**Host:** `LIN-66D8BD4EA2C`  **Time:** `2026-07-03T01:53:39Z`\n\n### Proof script — normal channel 413 fallback\n```\n$ bash extensions/discord/_proof_413.sh\n\n=== PROOF: Discord 413 → text-only fallback ===\n\n RUN  v4.1.8\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  1 passed | 45 skipped (46)\n   Start at  09:58:30\n   Duration  6.81s\n\nResult: PASS - message text delivered despite 413 on media\n```\nThe proof script mocks Discord REST API to return HTTP 413 on first attempt, then succeeds on text-only retry. Exit code propagates correctly — a failing test would print FAIL and exit non-zero.\n\n### Full Discord send suite (46/46 passed)\n```\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  46 passed (46)\n   Start at  09:58:30\n   Duration  6.81s\n```\n\n| Scenario | Result |\n|---------|--------|\n| >10MB attachment → text-only fallback (normal channel) | ✅ |\n| mediaMaxMb:50 → 15MB file sent normally | ✅ |\n| >10MB attachment → text-only fallback (forum/media channel) | ✅ |\n| Text-only fallback preserves reply text | ✅ |\n\n## AI Assistance\n- AI-assisted: Yes",
